{
  "id": "darkstar",
  "name": "OBNE Dark Star Stereo",
  "transport": "obne",
  "identify": "onOff",
  "noNotes": true,
  "folder": "OBNE Dark Star Stereo",
  "source": "Old Blood Noise Endeavors, Dark Star Stereo instruction manual pp. 4-5 (MIDI functions + CC table), https://oldbloodnoise.com/s/Dark-Star-Stereo.pdf",
  "obne": {
    "cc": 25,
    "start": 0,
    "confirm": 127
  },
  "liveNote": "the Dark Star can't be asked anything — live controls, preset select, and store (saved over MIDI; edit keeps its own copy)",
  "setup": [
    "MIDI in only: interface out → the pedal's MIDI IN (3.5mm TRS Type A). Its MIDI OUT is a thru — chain the next pedal off it.",
    "Default channel is 1. To move it, send CC 102 = new channel (1-16) on the current channel; give each chained pedal its own.",
    "Nothing can be read back: edit's copy of each preset you store here is the record (back it up from the library panel).",
    "What edit shows is the whole preset: store sends every control, so set the ones you didn't touch too (they start at noon)."
  ],
